WEBVTT

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:04.410
A clear chart starts with one useful
observation.

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:08.150
First, check the market you are viewing.

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:15.390
Choose one timeframe before adding any
drawings.

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:20.910
Look for a price area you want to observe.

00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:26.330
Select H-Line in the drawing toolbar.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:33.050
Click once on the chart to mark that level.

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:38.530
Pause and check where your line landed.

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:44.630
Return to Cursor when you finish drawing.

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:51.530
A marked level does not guarantee a price
reaction.

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:58.430
Practise marking one level, then explain why
you chose it.
